      "title": "PRD choices",
      "items": [
        "Manual mode retains optional design and sprint meeting steps.",
        "During sprint meetings, every role reviews the design and contributes UI/UX improvements.",
        "Accepted feedback updates the PRD and editable design artifacts before approval."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Auto mode",
      "items": [
        "Developer starts a feature; workspace metadata enables the automatic path.",
        "Research → PRD → design → sprint meeting → approvals → plans → implementation and validation.",
        "Only human-only decisions pause the flow; failed validation blocks completion."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Repository delivery",
      "items": [
        "Implement affected shared/core and backend work before dependent frontends.",
        "Reassess safe frontend parallelism after each validated stage.",
        "Read each submodule agent guide and relevant local skills before editing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Completion",
      "items": [
        "Each coding agent reports verified build, runtime, migration, and compatibility facts.",
        "Coordinator gives ordered developer Build, Run, and Roll out actions with breaking changes and validation limits.",
        "Report changed submodules and pointer status; mark unchecked external settings Unknown with an owner.",
